# debug.keystore is intentionally committed (NOT ignored) — see the comment
# next to signingConfigs.debugConfig in app/build.gradle.kts for why: a
# debug key isn't a real secret (well-known "android" password by Android's
# own convention), and keeping it stable and identical across every build is
# what lets a new debug APK install as an *update* over an old one instead
# of Android refusing it as a signature mismatch.
